CHIRP Plus
==========

CHIRP Plus is an unofficial, modified version of CHIRP
(https://chirpmyradio.com, https://github.com/kk7ds/chirp).

- Based on: CHIRP next-20261016, upstream commit 832d349e.
- Modified: since 18 October 2026. The full list of changes, with dates,
  is the git history of https://github.com/sacchetti84-dev/chirp-plus
  (every commit after 832d349e); README-PLUS.md describes them.
- Not made, reviewed or endorsed by the CHIRP project. "CHIRP" is the name
  of the original project and is used here only to say what this version
  is based on. Report problems with CHIRP Plus to CHIRP Plus, not to the
  CHIRP project.

